polish(P0): unify favicons + fix join-form validation + style join forms + value-prop

Executes P0 of the Claude Opus polish & improvement plan (AgentRouter review).

P0-1 DESIGN SYSTEM / CONSISTENCY
- Replaced 6KB base64 PNG favicon data-URIs in all page <head>s with the shared
  /assets/favicon-64.png (was 7 pages embedded + 3 with a different format).
- Fixed 404.html: broken /assets/favicon.svg link (404'd, file didn't exist) ->
  /assets/favicon-64.png; and bare .btn "Back to home" -> .btn btn-primary
  (bare .btn rendered transparent with no button chrome).

P0-2 JOIN-FLOW VALIDATION + A11Y (homepage #join-form, previously novalidate)
- Added for/id associations, name attrs + required to all 4 fields.
- Added #join-status (role=status, aria-live) for inline feedback.
- Real apply handler now validates (required + email regex), highlights invalid
  fields (.jfield.error), shows specific inline messages, and surfaces network
  errors instead of the old silent `catch {}`.
- Gated the demo success-reveal handler on form.dataset.applied='ok' so a
  failed/invalid submit no longer shows a false "success".
- Verified: empty->4 errors+messages, bad email->specific error, valid->real API
  (backend 409 "already pending" surfaced to user, not faked).

P0-3 BECOME-MEMBER VALUE PROP + FORM STYLING (real bug fix)
- FOUND: become-member/become-partner forms were UNSTYLED in live site — their
  .form-group/.form-section/.form-wrapper/.form-row live only in legacy
  ai-club.css which is no longer linked; inputs rendered as stark white default
  browser boxes on the dark page.
- Ported full form styling (dark glass inputs, grid .form-row, gradient button,
  focus states, select chevron) into new-design-system.css + added
  aria-live role=status to apply/partner status elements.
- Added value-prop strip (3 benefit cards) + "what happens next" 3-step above
  the form per Opus. Verified visually (dark glass form, gradient button, no
  white boxes).

Verified: all pages 200, 1 stylesheet, valid JSON-LD, 0 JS errors, no external
CDN. Follows ff05bcd + f62766d.
